Fazna works where data meets AI. She spent close to three years at DataBeat in Hyderabad, first as a digital media analyst and then as a senior data analyst, turning ad and media data into decisions with BigQuery and SQL.

In January 2026 she joined MediaMint's AI implementation team as an AI subject-matter expert. She studied data analytics at Digital University Kerala and comes from Adoor.
